<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-HUNGARY H1 NEW HOMES COMPLETITION FLAT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>TABLE-HUNGARY H1 NEW HOMES COMPLETITION FLAT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary has completed just</p>
<p>over 8,500 new homes in the first half of 1997, virtually</p>
<p>unchanged over the same period of 1996, the Central Statistical</p>
<p>Office (KSH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The number of approved building plans rose 2.2 percent to</p>
<p>12,301, the KSH said.</p>
<p>					Q1 1997    Q1 1996</p>
<p>    New homes			 8,523	8,592</p>
<p>    Approved plans		 12,301     12,037</p>
<p>NOTE - Due to seasonalities, new home completions in the</p>
<p>first quarter are usually disproportionately low compared with</p>
<p>full-year figures. New homes include both flats and houses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
